{"type":"standard","title":"Mike Kelly (Pennsylvania politician)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Mike Kelly (Pennsylvania politician)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q1431761","titles":{"canonical":"Mike_Kelly_(Pennsylvania_politician)","normalized":"Mike Kelly (Pennsylvania politician)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Mike Kelly (Pennsylvania politician)</span></span>"},"pageid":28932861,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a2/Mike_Kelly%2C_official_portrait%2C_112th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Mike_Kelly%2C_official_portrait%2C_112th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":440},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a2/Mike_Kelly%2C_official_portrait%2C_112th_Congress_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":2019,"height":2690},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1376124427","tid":"db1859a9-b645-11f1-9d7d-4312abb1efea","timestamp":"2026-09-22T05:24:17Z","description":"American politician (born 1948)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mike_Kelly_(Pennsylvania_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mike_Kelly_(Pennsylvania_politician)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mike_Kelly_(Pennsylvania_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Mike_Kelly_(Pennsylvania_politician)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mike_Kelly_(Pennsylvania_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Mike_Kelly_(Pennsylvania_politician)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mike_Kelly_(Pennsylvania_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Mike_Kelly_(Pennsylvania_politician)"}},"extract":"George Joseph \"Mike\" Kelly Jr. is an American politician and businessman who has been a U.S. representative since 2011, currently representing Pennsylvania's 16th congressional district. The district, numbered as the 3rd district from 2011 to 2019, is based in Erie and stretches from the northwest corner of the state to the outer northern suburbs of Pittsburgh in Butler County. He is a member of the Republican Party.","extract_html":"<p><b>George Joseph \"Mike\" Kelly Jr.</b> is an American politician and businessman who has been a U.S. representative since 2011, currently representing Pennsylvania's 16th congressional district. The district, numbered as the 3rd district from 2011 to 2019, is based in Erie and stretches from the northwest corner of the state to the outer northern suburbs of Pittsburgh in Butler County. He is a member of the Republican Party.</p>"}